      "title": "Gannon University",
      "description": "Gannon University  | Part Time Custodian Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Part Time Custodian Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title Part Time Custodian Posting Number AS858P Subdivision Campus Services Division Finance and Campus Operations Department Physical Plant, Custodial Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Gannon University, a Catholic university, seeks part-time and full-time custodians to join our team. We have multiple shifts available. This position performs routine cleaning and housekeeping tasks in the upkeep of campus buildings or areas of assignment. Must be able to support and promote the University’s Mission. ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS : 1. Empties trash containers and removes trash to disposal areas. 2. Cleans and dusts furniture, fixtures, shelving, cabinets, door and window trim, and related furnishings; waxes furniture. 3. Sweeps, mops, and waxes floors; vacuums and shampoos rugs, and carpets. 4. Washes and/or cleans pictures as well as windows and door glass. 5. Cleans restrooms/bathrooms; disinfects fixtures; replaces supplies. 6. Reports items that require repair and maintains stock of supplies. 7. Aids in moving furniture, supplies, and equipment between departments and throughout the campus. 8. May participate in setting up, arranging, and taking down furniture for special events. 10. May sweep or shovel snow from building entrances. 11. When assigned to priest housing: washes and dries dishes; cleans refrigerators, stoves, and kitchen areas; makes and changes bed linens; removes soiled laundry to the laundry facility; returns and puts away clean laundry. 12. Performs other duties as assigned within the scope, responsibility, and requirements of the job. Gannon University seeks excellence through inclusiveness and invites women and members of underrepresented groups to apply. Review of applications will begin immediately, and this position will remain open until filled. Gannon University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Required Qualifications Education: A high school diploma/ GED . Experience: One-to-two years of related experience Skills: Must have the ability to: follow verbal and written instructions; communicate and exchange routine information with coworkers, supervisors, or other personnel; read and comprehend work orders, right-to-know notices and product instructions; evaluate work conditions and operate cleaning equipment. Must have valid PA drivers license. Preferred Qualifications Knowledge of cleaning solutions and practices is preferred. Physical Demands Must be able to lift and carry 50 pounds and meet the physical demands associated with the responsibilities of this position. Exempt Status Non-Exempt Position Classification Support Service Position Type Staff Employment Status Part-Time Position Length 12M Hours per Week 16-24 hours per week Work Schedule Weekends mandatory Shift 1st Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Letter of Recommendation Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
