    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/14305": {
      "title": "Gannon University",
      "description": "Gannon University  | 2nd shift Custodian Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help 2nd shift Custodian Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title 2nd shift Custodian Posting Number AS1025P Subdivision Campus Services Division Finance and Campus Operations Department Physical Plant, Custodial Location Erie, Pa Position Summary The Custodian performs routine cleaning and housekeeping tasks in the upkeep of campus buildings or areas of assignment. Must be able to support and promote the University’s Mission. ESSENTIAL FUNCTIONS : 1. Empties trash containers and removes trash to disposal areas. 2. Cleans and dusts furniture, fixtures, shelving, cabinets, door and window trim, and related furnishings; waxes furniture. 3. Sweeps, mops, and waxes floors; vacuums and shampoos rugs, and carpets. 4. Washes and/or cleans pictures as well as windows and door glass. 5. Cleans restrooms/bathrooms; disinfects fixtures; replaces supplies. 6. Reports items that require repair and maintains stock of supplies. 7. Aids in moving furniture, supplies, and equipment between departments and throughout the campus. 8. May participate in setting up, arranging, and taking down furniture for special events. 10. May sweep or shovel snow from building entrances. 11. When assigned to priest housing: washes and dries dishes; cleans refrigerators, stoves, and kitchen areas; makes and changes bed linens; removes soiled laundry to the laundry facility; returns and puts away clean laundry. 12. Performs other duties as assigned within the scope, responsibility, and requirements of the job. We offer flexible work hours and a generous benefits package for full-time employees. Retirement Plan (403b) with 4.5% company match after one year of service Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage Paid vacation time plus 15 paid holidays Wellness programs Tuition benefit for yourself and eligible dependents Professional Development Free gym Access Gannon University seeks excellence through inclusiveness and invites women and members of underrepresented groups to apply. Review of applications will begin immediately, and this position will remain open until filled. Gannon University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Required Qualifications Education: A high school diploma/ GED . Experience: One-to-two years of related experience Skills: Must have the ability to: follow verbal and written instructions; communicate and exchange routine information with coworkers, supervisors, or other personnel; read and comprehend work orders, right-to-know notices and product instructions; evaluate work conditions and operate cleaning equipment. Preferred Qualifications Knowledge of cleaning solutions and practices is preferred. Valid PA drivers license is preferred. Physical Demands Must be able to lift and carry 50 pounds and meet the physical demands associated with the responsibilities of this position. Exempt Status Non-Exempt Position Classification Support Service Position Type Staff Employment Status Full-Time Position Length 12M Hours per Week 40 Work Schedule Wednesday - Sunday 3:00 PM - 11:30 PM Shift 2nd Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
