    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/15085": {
      "title": "Gannon University",
      "description": "Gannon University  | Near-Space Exploration Student Assistants AY26-27 Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Near-Space Exploration Student Assistants AY26-27 Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. This student assistant position does NOT come with tuition assistance. This appointment is for an academic year (fall and spring) but continuation in spring will be subject to performance evaluation in the end of fall semester. Apply on line and submit an up-to-date resume. Position Details Position Summary Position Title Near-Space Exploration Student Assistants AY26-27 Posting Number Division School of Engineering and Computing Department Col. of Engineering & Business Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Career Readiness Learning Objectives: Communication – Be able to clearly and effectively exchange information, ideas, facts, and perspectives with the faculty advisor and any others working on the assigned project. Critical Thinking – Be able to identify technical issues, as applicable, arising from project activities and come up with feasible approaches to addressing those issues. The ECE department is soliciting applications for multiple student assistant positions in the following job function: To assist an ECE faculty member in conducting lab and field experiments relevant to NASA mission-related research. Required Qualifications ** US citizenship REQUIRED — no exceptions Preferred Qualifications * Good communication skills, good teamwork, and being able to work under minimal supervision are desired. * Hands-on experience in laboratory work with electronic devices and software tools a plus. * Undergraduate students in electrical and cyber engineering preferred but other engineering majors will also be considered. Physical Demands Some lifting work is required, e.g. moving PC or small lab equipment from lab to lab or to field test sites. Posting Detail Information Number of Vacancies 3 Job Posting Open Date 08/20/2026 Job Posting Close Date 09/19/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants This student assistant position does NOT come with tuition assistance. This appointment is for an academic year (fall and spring) but continuation in spring will be subject to performance evaluation in the end of fall semester. Apply on line and submit an up-to-date resume. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you a United States Citizen? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
