    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/15210": {
      "title": "Gannon University  | Graduate Assistant for Computer and Information Science Department",
      "description": "Gannon University  | Graduate Assistant for Computer and Information Science Department Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Graduate Assistant for Computer and Information Science Department Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Posting Summary Position Title Graduate Assistant for Computer and Information Science Department Posting Number AS1171P Subdivision School of Engineering and Computing Division Col. of Engineering & Business Department Computer & Information Science Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Essential Functions: Student assistant job description should include, but not be limited to: • Researching, designing, implementing and managing software programs • Testing and evaluating new cryptography programs • Identifying areas for modification in existing RSA programs and subsequently developing these modifications • Writing and implementing efficient code • Determining operational practicality • Developing quality assurance procedures • Deploying software tools, processes, and metrics • Maintaining and upgrading existing systems • Working closely with other developers and professor. NACE Competencies: 1. Critical Thinking: Multi-task well in a fast-paced autonomous environment. 2. Professionalism: Prioritize and complete tasks to accomplish organizational goals. Dissemination of Results: Present the outcomes of your experience at Celebrate Gannon and/or other venues determined by the college. Required Qualifications Graduate student in Computer and Information Science. Preferred Qualifications N/A Physical Demands none Exempt Status Non-Exempt Position Classification Professional Position Type GA (Research, Teaching, Athletic Training) Employment Status Part-Time Position Length 4M Hours per Week 5 Work Schedule Office Hours - Depending On Candidate's Schedule Shift 1st Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Optional Documents Transcripts Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
