    "https://gannon.peopleadmin.com/postings/15194": {
      "title": "Gannon University  | 2026 Fall Graduate Assistant (Administrative Assistants/Category 3) - MPA",
      "description": "Gannon University  | 2026 Fall Graduate Assistant (Administrative Assistants/Category 3) - MPA Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help 2026 Fall Graduate Assistant (Administrative Assistants/Category 3) - MPA Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. This is a Graduate Assistant (Administrative) position with Dr. M. Zhang in the MPA program. You will report directly to him and he will also provide you with direction. Position Details Posting Summary Position Title 2026 Fall Graduate Assistant (Administrative Assistants/Category 3) - MPA Posting Number AS967P Subdivision Dept.Social & Organizatinal Studies Division Col.Humanities,Ed.&SocScience Department Org. Learning & Leadership Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Graduate Assistant will be working directly with Dr. M. Zhang for the MPA program. Required Qualifications Job Description: · Work 10 hours per week for a total of 150 hours for fifteen weeks per semester. · Work closely with your advisor on any research projects. · · Keep the social media accounts updated (instagram, twitter, facebook). · Help new MPA students’ orientation · Table in Waldron to bring awareness to the program. · Develop and put a few posters on Campus · Reach out to other schools to promote the program. · Develop and facilitate cooperative agreements (or MOU ) with any potential institutional partners · Other things requested by the advisor · Meet weekly with your advisor. Preferred Qualifications Organizational and communication skills are a must. meet deadlines of assognments Physical Demands Some lifting of 25-35 pounds occasionally. Exempt Status Non-Exempt Position Classification Support Service Position Type GA (Administrative) Employment Status Part-Time Position Length 9M Hours per Week 10 Work Schedule Office Hours - Depending On Candidate's Schedule Shift 1st Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Transcripts Letter of Recommendation Optional Documents Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
