      "title": "Gannon University",
      "description": "Gannon University  | Activities Programming Board Executive Board Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Search Position Description Library Log In /Create Account Help Activities Programming Board Executive Board Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. The job will be filled by current members of the APB E Board. Please do not apply unless you have been contacted by the student hiring manager directly. Position Details Position Summary Position Title Activities Programming Board Executive Board Posting Number Division Recreation & Wellness Department Student Development & Engagemt Location Erie, Pa Position Summary Contribute to the development of a diverse calendar of APB events, including dates, times, facilities, and cost each semester (subject to Core Leadership Team approval). This calendar should be updated regularly. Advisor should be made aware of all changes as they occur. Facilitate bi-weekly committee meetings with members and maintain communication with members weekly regarding upcoming events. Complete weekly office hours in the APB office Work to ensure that all events, promotions, meetings, etc. are inclusive for all students. Promote collaboration among APB and other student organizations on campus. Participate in the planning and implementation of the “all hands on deck” events outside of specific committee events Communicate on team platforms, including but not limited to Teams, and Outlook, and check them frequently. Compile lists of all supplies and needs for events to share with the Core Leadership Team. Perform other duties as assigned or deemed necessary by the Core Leadership Team. Required Qualifications Ability to work ten hours a week on APB tasks and events. Excellent public relations and customer service skills Willingness to accept supervision and constructive feedback along with the ability to follow directions, work under pressure, and work as a team towards a common goal. Preferred Qualifications Physical Demands N/A Posting Detail Information Number of Vacancies 8 Job Posting Open Date 08/24/2026 Job Posting Close Date 09/14/2026 Special Instructions to Applicants The job will be filled by current members of the APB E Board. Please do not apply unless you have been contacted by the student hiring manager directly. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Erie, Pennsylvania Campus 109 University Square Erie, Pennsylvania 16541 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 Ruskin, Florida Campus 105 Commercial Center Dr. Ruskin, Florida 33573 1-800-GANNON-U or 814-871-7000 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
